#. Key:	VSync
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(10)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(10)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,VSync"
msgid "Synchronize presentation with the display to reduce tearing. This may change input latency; the result depends on the display and rendering mode."
msgstr "使画面输出与显示器同步，以减少撕裂。这可能改变输入延迟，实际效果取决于显示器和渲染模式。"

#. Key:	SyncInterval
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(11)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(11)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,SyncInterval"
msgid "Choose how many display refresh intervals to wait between presentations while VSync is enabled. This is not an independent monitor refresh-rate setting."
msgstr "开启垂直同步时，选择每次画面输出之间等待几个显示刷新周期。这不是独立的显示器刷新率设置。"

#. Key:	FrameLimit
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(12)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(12)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,FrameLimit"
msgid "Limit the game's frame rate to reduce unnecessary GPU work. Zero removes this limit; VSync or other engine policies may still limit presentation."
msgstr "限制游戏帧率，减少不必要的 GPU 工作。零表示取消此限制；垂直同步或其他引擎策略仍可能限制实际输出。"

#. Key:	Gamma
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(13)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(13)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Gamma"
msgid "Adjust the brightness curve of the displayed image. Check both dark and bright detail and use small changes; this does not replace HDR brightness controls."
msgstr "调整画面的亮度曲线。请同时检查暗部和亮部细节，并小幅调整；它不能替代 HDR 亮度控制。"

#. Key:	GrayCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(16)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(16)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,GrayCaption"
msgid "Reference gray steps. This illustration is not a measurement or automatic display calibration."
msgstr "灰阶参考图。本图不代表测量结果，也不是自动显示器校准。"

#. Key:	Preset
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(17)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(17)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Preset"
msgid "Change the quality groups together. Editing a group separately produces a custom preset. Auto-detect prepares a recommendation which you can review before applying."
msgstr "一起调整各个画质组。单独调整某个组后会成为自定义预设。自动检测会生成建议，供你检查后再应用。"

#. Key:	ResolutionScale
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(18)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(18)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,ResolutionScale"
msgid "Change the internal render resolution relative to the output. Lower values reduce pixel work but soften the image. An active upscaler can own this value and disable manual editing."
msgstr "调整内部渲染分辨率相对于输出分辨率的比例。较低值减少像素计算，但画面会更柔和。启用的超分辨率算法可能接管此值并禁用手动编辑。"

#. Key:	Upscaler
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(19)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(19)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Upscaler"
msgid "Choose an available temporal reconstruction method. Vendor methods require their plugin and compatible hardware; unavailable methods cannot be selected."
msgstr "选择可用的时域重建方法。厂商方案需要对应插件和兼容硬件；不可用的方法无法选择。"

#. Key:	UpscalerQuality
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(20)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(20)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,UpscalerQuality"
msgid "Balance internal resolution against reconstruction quality. Available choices and their resolution ratios depend on the selected upscaler."
msgstr "在内部渲染分辨率与重建质量之间取舍。可选项及其分辨率比例取决于当前超分辨率算法。"

#. Key:	Sharpness
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(21)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(21)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Sharpness"
msgid "Adjust supported sharpening. Strong sharpening can emphasize edges and noise; the active rendering method decides whether this control is available."
msgstr "调整支持的锐化效果。过强的锐化可能突出边缘和噪点；此项是否可用取决于当前渲染方法。"

#. Key:	AAMethod
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(22)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(22)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,AAMethod"
msgid "Choose how jagged edges are smoothed. Temporal methods use previous frames; upscaling methods may require a compatible anti-aliasing method."
msgstr "选择平滑锯齿边缘的方法。时域方法会使用之前的帧；超分辨率算法可能需要兼容的抗锯齿方法。"

#. Key:	AAQuality
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(23)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(23)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,AAQuality"
msgid "Change the quality of the active anti-aliasing path. Its visual and performance effects depend on the selected method."
msgstr "调整当前抗锯齿路径的质量。画面和性能影响取决于所选方法。"

#. Key:	ViewDistance
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(24)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(24)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,ViewDistance"
msgid "Adjust the view-distance quality group. The game decides which objects and detail levels respond to this setting."
msgstr "调整视距画质组。哪些物体和细节层级响应此项，由游戏决定。"

#. Key:	Shadows
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(25)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(25)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Shadows"
msgid "Adjust shadow quality and distance. The exact effect depends on the active shadow method and the scene."
msgstr "调整阴影质量和距离。具体效果取决于当前阴影方法和场景。"

#. Key:	GI
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(26)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(26)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,GI"
msgid "Adjust indirect-lighting quality. Only lighting paths enabled by the game can respond to this setting."
msgstr "调整间接光照质量。只有游戏启用的光照路径会响应此项。"

#. Key:	Reflections
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(27)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(27)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Reflections"
msgid "Adjust reflection quality. The result depends on the reflection method, scene and supported rendering features."
msgstr "调整反射质量。效果取决于反射方法、场景及支持的渲染功能。"

#. Key:	PostProcess
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(28)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(28)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,PostProcess"
msgid "Adjust the quality of the game's post-processing effects. Individual effects must also be enabled by the game."
msgstr "调整游戏后期处理效果的质量。对应效果也需要由游戏启用。"

#. Key:	Textures
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(29)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(29)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Textures"
msgid "Adjust texture streaming quality. Higher quality can use more video memory; the visible result depends on the source textures and available memory."
msgstr "调整纹理流送质量。更高质量可能占用更多显存；可见效果取决于原始纹理和可用显存。"

#. Key:	Effects
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(30)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(30)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Effects"
msgid "Adjust the quality group used by visual effects. The game decides which effects and detail levels change."
msgstr "调整视觉特效使用的画质组。哪些效果和细节层级发生变化，由游戏决定。"

#. Key:	Foliage
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(31)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(31)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Foliage"
msgid "Adjust foliage quality and density where the game supports scalable vegetation."
msgstr "在支持可伸缩植被的游戏中，调整植被质量和密度。"

#. Key:	Shading
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(32)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(32)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Shading"
msgid "Adjust the engine's shading quality group. The affected materials and lighting features depend on the game."
msgstr "调整引擎的着色画质组。受影响的材质和光照功能取决于游戏。"

#. Key:	Volumetrics
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(33)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(33)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Volumetrics"
msgid "Adjust volumetric fog grid detail and temporal sampling. Higher settings can increase GPU cost in scenes using volumetric effects."
msgstr "调整体积雾的网格细节和时域采样。在使用体积效果的场景中，提高设置可能增加 GPU 开销。"

#. Key:	Anisotropy
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(34)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(34)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Anisotropy"
msgid "Improve texture clarity when viewing surfaces at an angle. The result depends on the texture and sampler settings."
msgstr "提高斜视表面时的纹理清晰度。效果取决于纹理和采样器设置。"

#. Key:	MotionBlur
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(35)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(35)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,MotionBlur"
msgid "Adjust motion-blur quality. The game's camera and post-processing settings decide the blur amount."
msgstr "调整运动模糊质量。实际模糊程度由游戏相机和后期处理设置决定。"

#. Key:	HardwareLumen
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(36)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(36)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,HardwareLumen"
msgid "Allow hardware ray tracing for Lumen when the project and graphics device support it. This does not enable ray tracing for an unsupported project or GPU."
msgstr "在项目和显卡支持时，允许 Lumen 使用硬件光线追踪。此项不能为不支持的项目或 GPU 启用光线追踪。"

#. Key:	VSM
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(37)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(37)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,VSM"
msgid "Select virtual shadow maps when supported by the project. Shadow quality and scene complexity also affect the result and cost."
msgstr "在项目支持时选择虚拟阴影贴图。阴影质量和场景复杂度也会影响效果与开销。"

#. Key:	ContactShadows
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(38)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(38)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,ContactShadows"
msgid "Enable supported contact-shadow rendering for fine detail near surfaces. Lights and materials must be configured to use it."
msgstr "启用支持的接触阴影，为表面附近添加细节。灯光和材质必须配置为使用此功能。"

#. Key:	FOV
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(39)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(39)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,FOV"
msgid "Adjust the gameplay camera's field of view. A wider view shows more of the surroundings and changes perceived perspective."
msgstr "调整游戏相机视野。更宽的视野能显示更多周围环境，也会改变透视感。"

#. Key:	MouseSensitivity
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(40)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(40)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,MouseSensitivity"
msgid "Scale mouse look movement. This affects the game's camera adapter, not the Windows pointer speed."
msgstr "调整鼠标控制视角的幅度。它影响游戏相机适配器，不改变 Windows 指针速度。"

#. Key:	GamepadSensitivity
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(41)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(41)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,GamepadSensitivity"
msgid "Scale camera rotation from the gamepad stick. Rotation is time-based so the selected response is independent of frame rate."
msgstr "调整手柄摇杆控制相机旋转的幅度。旋转按时间计算，使所选响应不依赖帧率。"

#. Key:	InvertX
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(42)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(42)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,InvertX"
msgid "Reverse horizontal camera look input."
msgstr "反转相机的水平视角输入。"

#. Key:	InvertY
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(43)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(43)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,InvertY"
msgid "Reverse vertical camera look input."
msgstr "反转相机的垂直视角输入。"

#. Key:	GamepadIcons
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(44)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(44)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,GamepadIcons"
msgid "Choose the button-label family shown in the interface. This changes presentation, not the physical input mapping."
msgstr "选择界面显示的手柄按钮标识样式。它只改变显示，不改变物理按键映射。"

#. Key:	ColorType
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(45)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(45)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,ColorType"
msgid "Choose a color-vision correction mode. Compare the color samples and adjust correction intensity for your preference."
msgstr "选择色觉校正模式。请对比颜色样本，并按个人需要调整校正强度。"

#. Key:	ColorIntensity
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(46)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(46)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,ColorIntensity"
msgid "Adjust color-vision correction strength. Zero preserves the uncorrected image."
msgstr "调整色觉校正强度。零保留未经校正的画面。"

#. Key:	Language
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(47)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(47)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,Language"
msgid "Choose one of the game's packaged interface languages. The regional number/date locale is retained separately."
msgstr "选择游戏已打包的界面语言。区域数字和日期格式单独保留。"

#. Key:	MasterVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(48)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(48)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,MasterVolume"
msgid "Scale all configured audio channels. Individual channel volumes multiply with the master volume."
msgstr "调整所有已配置音频通道的音量。各通道音量与主音量相乘。"

#. Key:	MusicVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(49)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(49)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,MusicVolume"
msgid "Adjust sounds routed through the music channel. Listen plays a reference sound through this route."
msgstr "调整通过音乐通道播放的声音。试听会通过此通道播放参考声音。"

#. Key:	EffectsVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(50)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(50)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,EffectsVolume"
msgid "Adjust sounds routed through the effects channel. Listen plays a reference sound through this route."
msgstr "调整通过音效通道播放的声音。试听会通过此通道播放参考声音。"

#. Key:	AmbientVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(51)
