msgstr "调整通过环境声通道播放的声音。试听会通过此通道播放参考声音。"

#. Key:	UIVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(52)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(52)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsHelp,UIVolume"
msgid "Adjust sounds routed through the interface channel. Listen plays a reference sound through this route."
msgstr "调整通过界面通道播放的声音。试听会通过此通道播放参考声音。"

#. Key:	OutputDevice
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(53)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(53)
