msgid "Choose an audio output endpoint or follow the system default. Switching is asynchronous; keep the page open until the operation finishes."
msgstr "选择音频输出设备，或跟随系统默认设备。切换为异步操作，请保持页面打开直到操作结束。"

#. Key:	UIScale
