msgstr "较大的界面元素可能减少同时可见的设置行。"

#. Key:	ScaleSmall
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(56)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsPresentation.cpp(56)
