msgid "Choose the game's output resolution. Borderless mode follows the desktop; internal rendering resolution is controlled separately."
msgstr "选择游戏的输出分辨率。无边框模式跟随桌面分辨率；内部渲染分辨率单独控制。"

#. Key:	SubtitlePreviewLine
