msgstr "对话字幕将以这样的方式显示。"

#. Key:	HDRPeakInstructions
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsViewModel.cpp(104)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsViewModel.cpp(104)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsUI,HDRPeakInstructions"
msgid "Increase peak brightness until the cross just blends into the bright patch. Display tone mapping can affect this comparison; use the display's rated peak if the cross never disappears. Apply saves the result; Revert restores your previous settings."
msgstr "提高峰值亮度，直到十字刚好融入亮色区域。显示器的色调映射可能影响比较；若十字始终不消失，请使用显示器的标称峰值。应用以保存结果，撤销以恢复原先设置。"

#. Key:	HDRWhiteInstructions
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsViewModel.cpp(105)
#: Plugins/DreamSettings/Source/DreamSettingsUI/Private/DreamSettingsViewModel.cpp(105)
msgctxt "DreamSettingsUI,HDRWhiteInstructions"
msgid "Adjust until the white patch feels comfortable for ordinary surfaces and text. The surrounding grey stays proportional to white. Peak highlights are adjusted separately. Apply saves the result; Revert restores your previous settings."
msgstr "调整亮度，直到白色区域适合日常画面和文字的舒适观看。周围灰色与白色保持相同比例，高光峰值需单独调整。应用以保存结果，撤销以恢复原先设置。"

